  < oid(1, testTa) : OperationHandle | state : init >
=>1
  < testTa : TaKernel | status : panic, api-state : finished,
                        current-api : SetOperationKey,
                        SETKEY-PANIC-ATTS:AttributeSet > C .

--- GP 6.2.6: a non-null key object must be initialized.
